# Discord Bot Integration for Crew Avatar & Name Sync
# 1. Create a Bot Application at https://discord.com/developers/applications
# 2. Enable "Server Members Intent" under Bot settings
# 3. Invite the bot to your server using OAuth2 URL Generator (scope: bot, permission: View Channels / 1024)
DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN=""

# (Optional) Discord Server ID / Guild ID to fetch per-server Nitro avatars & server nicknames
